# V6n finding for S6b's translator (reported, not an S6n defect): see docs/RENDER_VERIFY.md §7
size 4 4
rt A32B32G32R32F
ds D24S8
clear 7 0xff000000 1.0 0
rs CULLMODE CULL_NONE
vs @p4_nrm_zero
ps @tc
vsc 0 0 0 0 0
vsc 1 0.5 0.25 0.75 1
vdecl 0:0
vg -1 1 0.5 1
vg 1 1 0.5 1
vg -1 -1 0.5 1
vg 1 1 0.5 1
vg 1 -1 0.5 1
vg -1 -1 0.5 1
drawg TRIANGLELIST 2
